# Gitignored files that Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates
# (agent view, `claude --worktree`, subagents with `isolation: worktree`).
# Syntax is .gitignore syntax. A file is copied only if it matches a pattern
# here AND is gitignored, so tracked files are never duplicated.
# The datasets add about 700 MB per worktree. See docs/agent_view_guide.md.

# Secrets and personal Claude Code settings (permission approvals)
.env
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local datasets that tests and scripts read (see FULL_DATA_PATHS in
# tests/conftest.py). Without them, integration tests skip.
data/processed/**
data/benchmark/**

# ViFinQA: only what the code reads. The download cache
# data/external/ViFinQA/.cache/ is left out on purpose: inside a worktree its
# paths exceed the 260-character Windows limit, and git then fails to delete
# the worktree ("Filename too long"). Add new datasets here explicitly.
data/external/ViFinQA/financial_statements/**
data/external/ViFinQA/questions/**
data/external/ViFinQA/code_stock.csv
data/external/ViFinQA/README.md
